  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kofi Annan Int. Peacekeeping Training Centre KAIPTC support 2019-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KAIPTC is a research-based training institute focusing on peacekeeping and stability. Key objectives: Enhance the civilian capacity of ECOWAS, African Union (AU), United Nations (UN) and other relevant actors to perform their mandates in ensuring peace and security in Africa. Further, enhance civilian capacity to implement relevant protocols and resolutions on women, peace and security including the Maputo protocol and SCR1325.</narrative>
  </description>
